{
  "_README": [
    "A labelled test set for the photo-diagnosis path, drawn from the",
    "PlantVillage dataset (Mohanty, Hughes & Salathe 2016), released under",
    "CC0 1.0 -- public domain. The images are NOT stored in this repository:",
    "this file names them and scripts/fetch_diagnosis_set.py downloads them",
    "on demand. Nothing is redistributed, the repository stays small, and",
    "the set is reproducible because the sample is drawn with a fixed seed.",
    "",
    "Healthy leaves are a third of the set on purpose. A diagnostician that",
    "names a disease on a healthy plant is worse than one that misses a",
    "sick one: the farmer sprays for nothing, at cost, and learns to",
    "distrust the next answer.",
    "",
    "These are laboratory images on plain backgrounds. Real photographs from",
    "a field have soil, shadow, several leaves and a shaking hand, and this",
    "set says nothing about those. Treat any score here as an upper bound."
  ],
